            "review_title": "Review at HOME Cafe Pub",
            "review_text": "heo_2017\n2 contributions\n0\nExcellent restaurant\nDec 2017 • Family\nThis is my favorite restaurant in Nha Trang. I have been here many times over the last few months, and the service has never let me down not even once.\nThe restaurant offers a wide range of food, like western grilled steak, asian hot pot,... Especially very fresh seafood.\nThe price is very reasonable (if not saying cheap), even to local people. \nThe service is excellent. It was a sunny day and my table was too much exposed to the sun. So everything was moved to a new table with ease though food was served on my table.\nI highly recommend this place to everyone.\nJust drop by the place and enjoy good food and service!\nRead more\nWritten December 17, 2017",
